      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيَّفَنِى</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a thing, S, O, K) <i>sufficed me for
my</i> [<i>season termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيْفَة</span>, (S, O, K,) or <i>for my</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيْف</span>: (Msb:) by the “ thing ” here spoken of
is meant food, or a garment, or some other thing.
(TA.) ― 
